{
  "slug": "review-all",
  "name": "Review All",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Comprehensive, project-agnostic, multi-agent code review for Claude Code with verification to eliminate false positives.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **1 skill**, `review-all` (Multi-agent code review for diffs (project-agnostic)).\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install review-all@claude-community` from `ncoevoet/claude-review-all`.\n\nProject-agnostic code review for Claude Code. One slash command runs deterministic gates, ten parallel review agents, and an adversarial verification pass. Every finding cites `file:line` and is independently re-checked before the report — false positives stay out.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude",
    "copilot",
    "antigravity",
    "codex"
  ],
  "pluginType": "wrapper",
  "wrapper": "skill",
  "sourceType": "community",
